WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.870
Shared gear. Accountable money.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.946
Sharing equipment should be simple. So should
knowing where the money goes.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:19.282
Choose a kit. Review the usage fee,
refundable bond, and retained storage before
you reserve.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.186
The borrower reserves. The custodian records
pickup. Return evidence keeps the next step
clear.

5
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:40.818
A clean return? The full bond becomes
borrower credit. The community receives the
usage fee.

6
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:50.450
If damage is disputed, the council decides.
One approval leaves the money in escrow. Two
approvals authorize settlement.

7
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Credits first. Withdrawals next.

8
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:04.330
Open the verifier. Inspect the case, both
votes, and the actual payments. Anyone can
run fresh, read-only checks.

9
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.466
Common Kit. Shared gear. Accountable money.
Explore the testnet demo.

